      "path": "packages/belay/Belay/Sqlite/CheckObservation.lean",
      "rule": "R10",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "View-equivalence explanations discard both views, so identity and quiet views of the same program incorrectly report different connections instead of different projected traces. Fix: describe the observations projected by the claim’s views."
    },
    {
      "id": "20261027T034619Z-81dfc318#3",
      "line": 270,
      "path": "plans/20261024-s6-automation.status.md",
      "rule": "R19",
      "severity": "must",
      "text": "The status claims that explanation exhaustion preserves a refutation, but `observeFailure` can consume the enclosing budget and cause `Check.check` to return unknown. Fix: restrict the guarantee to shrinking and record explanation exhaustion as unresolved."
    },
    {
