      "path": "tests/surface/S6CheckPrograms.lean",
      "rule": "R11",
      "severity": "should",
      "text": "The budget fixture expects unknown and does not test the new guarantee that an accepted refutation survives shrinking exhaustion. Fix: add a deterministic regression that exhausts shrinking after certification and replay and still requires false."
    },
